          "type": "text",
          "text": "Site engineers considered restricted transport access while preparing a replacement design for the village festival display. Paper lanterns will surround the display without touching its surface. A later inspection will compare the finished dimensions with this record. A cone has radius 8 cm and perpendicular height 12 cm. Find its volume in cm³, correct to 1 decimal place."
        }
